If you drink, don't drive. Don't even putt.
Has this world been so kind to you that you should leave with regret?
There are better things ahead than any we leave behind.
Mules are always boasting that their ancestors were horses.
The secret of getting things done is to act!
Life belongs to the living, and he who lives must be prepared for
changes.
Abandon all hope, you who enter here!
England has two books, one which she has made and one which has made
her: Shakespeare and the Bible.
All our dreams can come true, if we have the courage to pursue them.
The best mirror is an old friend.
You can employ men and hire hands to work for you, but you must win
their hearts to have them work with you.
Aging seems to be the only available way to live a long life.
Ah just act the way ah feel.
He is happy whom circumstances suit his temper but he Is more excellent
who suits his temper to any circumstance.
You cannot step twice into the same river, for other waters are
continually flowing on.
If you think you have trouble supporting a wife, try not supporting her.
Divorce is a declaration of independence with only two signers.
Personal satisfaction is the most important ingredient of success.
Youth is the gift of nature, but age is a work of art.
Art is the symbol of the two noblest human efforts: to construct and to
refrain from destruction.

 

